+4. **D108 is the fastest live interface; an all-degree realizability obstruction remains the strongest proof route.** Absolute polynomial-Keller degree results do not apply to `.73` K7 charts with `J=x^k`. K16 is only a prototype; its next useful result must cover every actual `m`, coefficient factor, and the `b=0` boundary.
