+
+Observed work and correction cost favor Astra for primary integration/structural synthesis; Sol for bounded exact certificates, with literal theorem readings scope-gated; Opus for narrow hostile source extraction, since its valuable objection prompted the right check but its endpoint reversal makes independent definition review mandatory; Fable only for conditional hostile hypotheses until its unread proof/gate bodies, arbitrary-degree filtering, support/novelty claims, `.73` classification, stopping-sweep proposal, and quarantined workflow are corrected. Coordinator/root remains the arbiter. These are task roles, not votes.
